  - commit `c742dd6`: `arkan-mode`'s autonomous run, perf issue, hillclimb, eval, runtime forensics, trace forensics, visual parity, orchestrate and worktree cleanup playbooks, `skills/arkan-mode/scripts/worktree-audit.sh`, `principle-explain-the-number`, `arena`, `interrogate`, `correct`, `arkan-help` (from `poteto-help`, ported, changed) and `statechart` (adapted, without its test corpus), plus restored content in `technical-writing`, `recall`, `why` and `arkan-mode`'s review-bot triage, the current `sharpen`, the `statechart` pointer in `formal-verification`, and the explain-the-number wording in `skills/arkan-mode/SKILL.md`.
  - agents: `agents/comment-sicko.md` (a copy of pstack's `agents/comment-sicko.md` at `d457567`, with omp frontmatter) and `agents/arkan-agent.md` (a rewrite of pstack's `agents/poteto-agent.md` at `c742dd6` for omp).
